  "",
  "Since the war between the Earth",
  "Federation and the Principality",
  "of Zeon, seven years had passed.",
  "But this war, which wiped out",
  "over half the total population,",
  "left the Earth Sphere devastated.",
  "An Earth environment ravaged",
  "beyond repair; adults in their",
  "prime dead; the collapse of",
  "sophisticated computer networks;",
  "chronic food shortages caused by",
  "two colony drops.",
  "Yet the Earth Federation",
  "government insisted that the blame",
  "for all this chaos lay with",
  "the Principality of Zeon",
  "and the Zabi family,",
  "and never changed its way",
  "of ruling space from Earth.",
  "They ate the food grown by",
  "the people of space, hoarded",
  "what nature Earth had left, and,",
  "backed by Earth Federation arms,",
  "sought to make old glories theirs.",
  "If war did not come of this,",
  "that would be a lie.",
  "In the blink of an eye,",
  "the fires of protest flared up",
  "all across the Earth Sphere.",
  "Not only were there near-daily",
  "demonstrations in every colony",
  "and on the Moon; even sensible",
  "Earth residents openly",
  "protested against the Federation.",
  "The thesis first proclaimed when",
  "the Earth Federation was founded,",
  "the ideal of Zeon Deikun--protect",
  "the Earth and unite humanity--",
  "was still alive.",
  "That this movement against",
  "Earth supremacy turned",
  "into armed struggle",
  "was not because people learned",
  "nothing from the One Year War",
  "or the Delaz Conflict.",
